# Sooty Earth release freeze

Do not open or merge a pull request from `develop` into `main` until a production release is explicitly requested. `main` deploys Fly app `naturewatch-demo` (naturewatch.space). `develop` deploys Fly app `naturewatch` and is where this work lands.

Before implementing a roadmap step, read `docs/sooty-earth-roadmap.md`. One step per branch and chat. Merge that step into `develop` only. Pipelines stay in `marynvdl/naturewatch-analysis`. The crop, built, and bare virtual-machine tasks are retired under `archive/vm-tile-tasks/`. `tasks/fireTiles/` builds fire tiles on a GitHub-hosted runner, started by hand. Do not push a commit that restores the old virtual-machine workflows.

Do not start the next step until the current step's done-when is met.
